	<!--
	  Xceed assemblies are embedded and resolved at runtime by AssemblyLoadContext_Resolving,
	  which matches a manifest resource whose name ends with "<AssemblyName>.dll". All four are
	  shipped because that suffix match, not the TFM, decides which one a request resolves to.
	-->
